WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.099 --> 00:00:04.370
OK, so many of you have asked me to talk about
this.

00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:08.690
I've gotten dozens of emails, a handful of
voicemails, a bunch of messages during live

00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:14.020
stream saying, David, you really need to investigate
and talk about some of the claims that are

00:00:14.020 --> 00:00:18.950
being made by members of Congress and their
staff, that some aspect of the Trump riots

00:00:18.950 --> 00:00:25.990
suggest some kind of inside job or coordination
either with members of Congress or with with

00:00:25.990 --> 00:00:27.180
law enforcement.

00:00:27.180 --> 00:00:28.630
And I think it's very important.

00:00:28.630 --> 00:00:33.050
It would be irresponsible for me not to say
that at this point what we have is a set of

00:00:33.050 --> 00:00:37.780
allegations, many of which are still being
investigated and sort of nebulous.

00:00:37.780 --> 00:00:41.309
But this has come to a level where we should
talk about it.

00:00:41.309 --> 00:00:43.499
So there's a few different things going on
here.

00:00:43.499 --> 00:00:50.199
First of all, there have been concerning patterns
of posts and communications involving some

00:00:50.199 --> 00:00:56.069
right wing members of Congress, in particular
new Congresswoman Lauren Bobert.

00:00:56.069 --> 00:01:00.379
And it sort of exceeds the scope of this segment
to go through the minutia piece by piece.

00:01:00.379 --> 00:01:06.780
But you can easily Google this and sort of
explore this path yourself, where she appears

00:01:06.780 --> 00:01:13.789
to have been communicating and putting out
information that could just be sort of generally

00:01:13.789 --> 00:01:18.950
supportive of the idea of of a of a big protest,
which is what Donald Trump is claiming he

00:01:18.950 --> 00:01:19.950
did.

00:01:19.950 --> 00:01:25.689
But it ended up inciting a riot or maybe based
on her being pictured with some individuals

00:01:25.689 --> 00:01:28.259
that seemed to be riot folks.

00:01:28.259 --> 00:01:30.689
Maybe she was in some way connected or involved.

00:01:30.689 --> 00:01:34.090
And there are sort of a number of allegations
along that front.

00:01:34.090 --> 00:01:40.490
There is also the very disturbing allegation
that has come from a Capitol Hill staffer.

00:01:40.490 --> 00:01:48.109
That office panic buttons were removed in
advance of the pro Trump riotous insurrection.

00:01:48.109 --> 00:01:50.150
Her name is Sarah Growe.

00:01:50.150 --> 00:01:54.740
She's the chief of staff of Democratic Congresswoman
Ayanna Pressley.

00:01:54.740 --> 00:02:01.610
And she said that she, along with others,
were taking refuge in Ianna Presley's office

00:02:01.610 --> 00:02:09.140
as protesters and rioters flooded in and that
they barricaded the door with furniture and

00:02:09.140 --> 00:02:10.140
they were in there.

00:02:10.140 --> 00:02:15.780
And then they looked for the panic buttons
and the panic buttons were gone, saying every

00:02:15.780 --> 00:02:21.200
panic button in my office had been torn out
and saying they could not find any rationale

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:25.950
as to why that took place, saying they've
used them before, that they had not switched

00:02:25.950 --> 00:02:32.550
offices and that there were panic buttons
in that office which were subsequently gone.

00:02:32.550 --> 00:02:33.600
What is the explanation for that?

00:02:33.600 --> 00:02:34.700
We don't know.

00:02:34.700 --> 00:02:35.750
We simply don't know.

00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:40.520
At this point in time it's being investigated
and it should be investigated.

00:02:40.520 --> 00:02:45.010
We also heard from Congressman James Clyburn
and James Clyburn, Clyburn explained.

00:02:45.010 --> 00:02:52.860
I'm going to play a clip for you momentarily
that he has a marked office at the Capitol,

00:02:52.860 --> 00:02:57.820
which says Congressman James Clyburn, that
that is marked office, but that as majority

00:02:57.820 --> 00:03:04.980
whip, he tends to work at an unmarked office
in a different part of the building and that

00:03:04.980 --> 00:03:10.450
somehow the riders knew exactly where to go,
even though it was an unmarked office.

00:03:10.450 --> 00:03:11.670
This is him explaining it.

00:03:11.670 --> 00:03:12.670
Take a listen to this.

00:03:12.670 --> 00:03:16.430
The next part of this, which is what makes
this even more troubling with what you were

00:03:16.430 --> 00:03:19.480
sharing with our folks this morning.

00:03:19.480 --> 00:03:25.010
Part two of this, of what you were reporting
about is talk about the damage to your offices.

00:03:25.010 --> 00:03:27.430
You have two different offices in the Capitol.

00:03:27.430 --> 00:03:29.570
Explain it to our viewers.

00:03:29.570 --> 00:03:36.530
Well, I have an office in the capital, which
is in the so-called Lincoln Room, named after

00:03:36.530 --> 00:03:39.430
Abraham Lincoln.

00:03:39.430 --> 00:03:43.740
That office, that's my name on the door, and
the House majority whip above the door.

00:03:43.740 --> 00:03:48.230
It is just off of Statuary Hall.

00:03:48.230 --> 00:03:52.580
Anybody walking through Statuary Hall can
see that office.

00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:55.040
Now, that's not where I do.

00:03:55.040 --> 00:03:59.710
Most of my work up on the third floor is where
I do most of my work.

00:03:59.710 --> 00:04:05.350
And there are many members of the United States
Congress right now who could not tell you

00:04:05.350 --> 00:04:10.770
for that office is and could not find that
office if they needed to.

00:04:10.770 --> 00:04:12.240
Yeah, I've been there.

00:04:12.240 --> 00:04:13.320
It's hard to find, sir.

00:04:13.320 --> 00:04:14.320
I agree.

00:04:14.320 --> 00:04:15.630
It is not easy.

00:04:15.630 --> 00:04:16.630
Yes.

00:04:16.630 --> 00:04:18.850
Yeah, but they found it.

00:04:18.850 --> 00:04:27.000
Nobody touched the door where my name is,
but they were on the floor and my staff was

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:28.870
inside my inner office.

00:04:28.870 --> 00:04:35.280
Furniture piled at the door with people trying
to get in the door did not let them in.

00:04:35.280 --> 00:04:40.110
My question is, how did they know where that
office was?

00:04:40.110 --> 00:04:48.940
That, to me, needs a thorough investigation,
and I do believe that there are some sensitivities

00:04:48.940 --> 00:04:49.940
here.

00:04:49.940 --> 00:04:55.870
There were people taking selfies.

00:04:55.870 --> 00:05:00.260
With these insurrectionist, something's wrong
here, right?

00:05:00.260 --> 00:05:03.330
So, again, very troubling allegations.

00:05:03.330 --> 00:05:10.200
The explanation for which, you know, individually
any of these stories might have some explanation

00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:11.970
that's relatively benign.

00:05:11.970 --> 00:05:13.520
I've not heard it yet.

00:05:13.520 --> 00:05:21.970
And so I want to be, again, as I've said before,
an unending, unsatisfying bowl.

00:05:21.970 --> 00:05:27.960
Endless skepticism gets us into conspiracy
theory territory where both evidence for and

00:05:27.960 --> 00:05:32.370
lack of evidence and evidence against all
this, all is evidence for the conspiracy.

00:05:32.370 --> 00:05:34.950
I'm not going to fall into that at this point.

00:05:34.950 --> 00:05:43.080
I've seen enough that says to me I am not
understanding why these different things took

00:05:43.080 --> 00:05:45.990
place, if indeed they took place as they are
being alleged.

00:05:45.990 --> 00:05:47.480
And it certainly needs to be investigated.

00:05:47.480 --> 00:05:53.820
And we've since learned about a number of
different officers involved with the Capitol

00:05:53.820 --> 00:05:58.280
Police, Capitol Police officers who have been
suspended and are being investigated for their

00:05:58.280 --> 00:05:59.480
roles.

00:05:59.480 --> 00:06:06.139
And we already know it's not within the realm,
beyond the realm of reality, that Capitol

00:06:06.139 --> 00:06:12.380
Police acted at least some people incorrectly
during this.

00:06:12.380 --> 00:06:14.660
And it must be investigated how far this goes.

00:06:14.660 --> 00:06:18.670
I think that that's roughly and I know that
many of you wish I could be more definitive

00:06:18.670 --> 00:06:19.870
about this.

00:06:19.870 --> 00:06:22.360
That's basically my thought about it at this
point in time.

00:06:22.360 --> 00:06:23.380
The allegations are troubling.

00:06:23.380 --> 00:06:27.070
And if they are true or even part of them
are true, there's quite a bit of explaining

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:28.080
that needs to be done.

00:06:28.080 --> 00:06:43.560
We will continue following 

00:06:43.560 --> 00:06:55.960
it 

00:06:55.960 --> 00:06:56.120
up

